and execution and SYSTEM token impersonation\n- keep live targets, VPN material, credentials, literal flags, and proof hashes in gitignored `.context` records\n\n## Lessons preserved\n\n- a connected VPN UI is not proof that the target subnet uses the right route\n- a commercial VPN can silently nest and destabilize the HTB tunnel\n- a local or bundled flag is not a live win, and one flag is not a two-flag win\n- database sysadmin is a capability boundary; inspect the OS service token before selecting privilege escalation\n- change implementations after a proven primitive fails instead of discarding the evidence-backed hypothesis\n- clean up staged tools and restore modified service configuration\n\n## Validation\n\n- skill validator: `quick_validate.py .claude/skills/solve-ctf-challenges`\n- `git diff --check`\n- public-diff scan for target IPs, literal flags, profile identifiers, certificates, and private keys\n- repo-wide checks intentionally left to CI at the user request because the local device is resource constrained\n","created_at":"2026-10-02T23:03:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T20:31:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2ec1f43b575d1d33f8aef5aa940db9ebe38e55a6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/pulls/26/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/pulls/26/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/issues/26/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/statuses/e392f1ae791b28b521296eb900a1b1bd8c79f247","head":{"label":"cogni-dao:derekg1729/bypass-expense-cap","ref":"derekg1729/bypass-expense-cap","sha":"e392f1ae791b28b521296eb900a1b1bd8c79f247","user":{"login":"cogni-dao","id":225770772,"node_id":"O_kgDODXT9FA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi